Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.54,0:00:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,《The Angel》(North London Forever)\NLouis Dunford
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As I walk these streets alone\N♪ 当我独行于北伦敦的街道 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Through this borough I call home\N♪ 穿过我家这块街区 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon the barren fields of Highbury\N♪ 在海布里的贫瘠田野上 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.03,0:00:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,'Neath the stadiums of stone\N♪ 走在石筑的阿森纳酋长球场之下 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the turnstiles at The Angel\N♪ 穿过天使地铁站的闸机 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,See the homeless on the green\N♪ 看见流浪汉安静地呆在草坪上 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.14,0:00:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,From The Cally to The Cross\N♪ 从卡利街到国王十字街区 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And every shithole in between\N♪ 以及其间的每个阴暗的街区角落 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass the church, the mosque, a crack den\N♪ 经过教堂、清真寺与贩毒窟 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And the offie on the corner\N♪ 还有街角的廉价贩酒铺子 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,See the brasses from the brothel\N♪ 瞧见妓院的妓女 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That pretends to be a sauna\N♪ 伪装成桑拿房做生意 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch the bedlam in the bookies\N♪ 目睹投注站吵吵嚷嚷地投注 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,See the winners and the losers\N♪ 然后有人收米-有人上天台 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeking solace from their sorrow\N♪ 在本地小酒馆中 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In the local battle cruisers\N♪ 依靠喝酒来寻找安慰 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the madness in the market\N♪ 穿过市集的喧嚣 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Weathered faces turn to greet ya\N♪ 沧桑的面庞转向你问候 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hello guv'nor, how's your mother?"\N♪ "张老板，您母亲身体可好？" ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"You alright, son? Be lucky, geezer"\N♪ "弟弟最近在哪发财？祝好运啊你小子" ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Double pie and mash and liquor\N♪ 老板来份双份的肉馅饼配土豆泥与肉汁 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A cuppa Rosie Lee, old chap\N♪ 再来杯红茶，老伙计 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Or watch retired gangsters bicker\N♪ 看退休黑帮老哥混迹在亚瑟咖啡馆 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day in Arthur's café\N♪ 日复一日地吵了巴火的 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The little f**kers causing trouble\N♪ 还有惹是生非的小混混们 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,For the cozzers make you smile\N♪ 警察静静地看他们装X笑而不语 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You meet your muckers for a couple\N♪ 啥也不说了与好兄弟小酌几杯 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget your troubles for a while\N♪ 烦忧暂抛脑后 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,From The Thornhill to The Hemmy\N♪ 从索恩希尔(工人阶层酒吧)到汉姆斯塔德(高大上的富人区) ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.30,0:01:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All the faces are the same\N♪ 熟悉的面孔始终如一 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause the manor might be changing\N♪ 街区或许拆了又建门店改头换面 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.03,0:01:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But the people still remain\N♪ 但老居民们仍然还在 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.69,0:01:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,North London Forever!\N♪ 永远的北伦敦！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever the weather\N♪ 无论阴晴风雨 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,These streets are our own\N♪ 这些街道属于我们 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.91,0:01:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And my heart will leave you Never\N♪ 我的心不会和北伦敦分离 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.90,0:01:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My blood will Forever\N♪ 我的血脉将永远 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.48,0:01:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Run through the stone\N♪ 流淌于这石砌之地 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.34,0:02:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,As I walk these streets alone\N♪ 当我独行于北伦敦街道 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.17,0:02:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Through a kingdom made of chrome\N♪ 走过后来用新的铬合金和玻璃幕墙构筑铸新楼 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.41,0:02:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I see them ripping up the cobbles\N♪ 把老地方鹅卵石都撬开全换了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And tearing down our childhood homes\N♪ 所以拆了我们童年的家 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.75,0:02:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the architecture changing\N♪ 我目睹了一个个建筑更迭变换 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.79,0:02:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch the history disappear\N♪ 过往的回忆历史在眼前消逝 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.73,0:02:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And the skyline rearranging\N♪ 天际线仿佛也重新排列 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.65,0:02:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Into towers of veneer\N♪ 化作虚饰的塔楼 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.23,0:02:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But I see the remnants of a London\N♪ 但我仍记着北伦敦以前的老样子 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That they thought they could erase\N♪ 他们妄想抹去以前老地方的痕迹 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.86,0:02:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I hear the old school\N♪ 每当听老一辈谈起 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.58,0:02:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about the good old days\N♪ 往昔美好社区岁月 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.48,0:02:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Or every time I watch the football\N♪ 或与兄弟看我厂干曼联时 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And have a ruby with the lads\N♪ 一起聚会吃咖喱餐 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See a hoister selling clobber\N♪ 看见暗地里贩卖处理偷来的脏污 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a dealer shooting bags\N♪ 有的毒贩分装白粉 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.10,0:02:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the single mothers juggling\N♪ 但有些来自于迫于生活兼顾养家与赚钱的 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.27,0:02:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A baby and a job\N♪ 带孩子的离异母亲 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In every single brother struggling\N♪ 也有很多是挣扎讨口饭吃 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.88,0:02:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That wound up in the dock\N♪ 赚不到钱的老哥们 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.44,0:02:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the roots and the foundations\N♪ 说白了这是这里根啊 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.80,0:02:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still clinging to the land\N♪ 血脉和根基是不会分开的 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.56,0:02:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the bricks that built the Morland\N♪ 后来也拆掉莫兰大厦改建成高档公寓 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And Popham that still stand\N♪ 与屹立的波帕姆的砖石中 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in my family and my friends\N♪ 北伦敦的根始终在家人与朋友间 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:02:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In every gram and every Benz\N♪ 也在每克毒品与每辆奔驰里 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the roots that we inherit\N♪ 它在世代传承的根脉中 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When a generation ends\N♪ 当一代人逝去时 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the ruins of your youth\N♪ 它在青春的废墟里 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.02,0:03:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And the faces of your past\N♪ 与往昔的面容中 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause the manor might be changing\N♪ 北伦敦街区或许在变迁 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But the people always last\N♪ 但人民永存 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,North London Forever!\N♪ 永远的北伦敦！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever the weather\N♪ 无论阴晴风雨 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.13,0:03:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,These streets are our own\N♪ 这些街道属于我们 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And my heart\N♪ 而我的心 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Will leave you Never\N♪ 永不与你分离 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.63,0:03:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My blood will Forever\N♪ 我的血脉将永远 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Run Through the Stone\N♪ 流淌于这石砌之地 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.97,0:03:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,加油阿森纳！COYG！